ont-family: 'Noto Sans',Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; color: #5E5A78; max-width: 760px">Ja. Je kijkt mee en kunt opmerkingen plaatsen. Ons team bekijkt elke video voordat hij live gaat.</p></details><details style="border-top: 1px solid #E3E0EC; padding: 22px 0"><summary style="cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; font-family: Montserrat,Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: clamp(17px, 1.6vw, 20px); color: #2E2B48; min-height: 32px">Op welk account komt de video?<span class="plus" aria-hidden="true" style="width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid #E3E0EC; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2E2B48" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary><p style="margin: 12px 0 0; font-family: 'Noto Sans',Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; color: #5E5A78; max-width: 760px">Op het eigen Instagram en TikTok van de creator. Je mag de video ook op je eigen kanalen gebruiken.</p></details><details style="border-top: 1px solid #E3E0EC; padding: 22px 0"><summary style="cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; font-family: Montserrat,Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: clamp(17px, 1.6vw, 20px); color: #2E2B48; min-height: 32px">Moet de creator uit mijn regio komen?<span class="plus" aria-hidden="true" style="width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid #E3E0EC; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2E2B48" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary><p style="margin: 12px 0 0; font-family: 'Noto Sans',Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; color: #5E5A78; max-width: 760px">Nee. We kiezen op hoe goed iemand bij je zaak en je gasten past.</p></details><details style="border-top: 1px solid #E3E0EC; padding: 22px 0"><summary style="cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; font-family: Montserrat,Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: clamp(17px, 1.6vw, 20px); color: #2E2B48; min-height: 32px">Zit ik ergens aan vast?<span class="plus" aria-hidden="true" style="width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid #E3E0EC; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2E2B48" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary><p style="margin: 12px 0 0; font-family: 'Noto Sans',Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; color: #5E5A78; max-width: 760px">De kennismaking is vrijblijvend. Looptijd en opzeggen bespreken we in het gesprek.</p></details><div style="border-top: 1px solid #E3E0EC"></div></section><section style="max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; padding-left: 24px; padding-right: 24px; box-sizing: border-box; padding-top: clamp(56px, 7vw, 96px); padding-bottom: clamp(56px, 7vw, 96px)">
